<title>UK: Gen Accident hit by premium tax worries.</title>
<headline>Gen Accident hit by premium tax worries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in composite insurer General Accident Plc slipped in line with a mostly weaker sector on Tuesday after press comments raised fears about the possibility of higher premium charges, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in General Accident shed 5-1/2p to 957-1/2p after earlier trading around 975p immediately after the company reported record operating profits.</p>
</text>
